OL,3,GNEWSABank fined #2m for financial crime
OL,4,Acontrol failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bank has been fined #2m for failing
OL,7,Fto consistently act on transactions
OL,8,Fwhich presented risks of financial
OL,9,Fcrime.
OL,11,FThe Jersey Financial Services
OL,12,FCommission issued the civil financial
OL,13,Fpenalty to the Jersey Branch of HSBC
OL,14,FBank plc for "negligent, significant
OL,15,Fand material" regulation breaches.
OL,17,FA review between October 2019 and May
OL,18,F2023 found the bank failed to recognise
OL,19,Fand scrutinise notable transactions for
OL,20,F15 customers. It added enhanced
OL,21,Fmeasures were not implemented where
OL,22,Ffinancial crime concerns were reported.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
