OL,3,GNEWSABank fined #2m for financial crime
OL,4,Acontrol failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bank's chief executive officer,
OL,7,FWarwick Long, said it had
OL,8,F"significantly invested in and
OL,9,Fproactively implemented operational and
OL,10,Ftechnical enhancements" to strengthen
OL,11,Fits control.
